美元 B 轮融资，估值 31 亿美元并发布 Alignment Index","title_en":"We’re incredibly proud to continue working with @thehousefund!","url":"https://x.com/arena/status/2108310714423423254"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/jxxgoidojk52fkcs2fz0fkjzy","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-models","id":"jxxgoidojk52fkcs2fz0fkjzy","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/jxxgoidojk52fkcs2fz0fkjzy","published_at":"2026-10-08T20:02:39Z","ref":"A4","score":71,"selected":true,"source":"X：Arena (@arena)","summary":"Arena 公布 Anthropic Claude Haiku 5.5 (High) 的真实评测结果，在 Code Arena: WebDev 以 1587 分首秀排名第 30，略在 Pareto 前沿之外。","title":"Arena 公布 Claude Haiku 5.5 (High) 真实评测结果：Code Arena 1587 分首秀第 30 名","title_en":"Real-world results are in for Claude Haiku 5.5 (High) by @AnthropicAI.","url":"https://x.com/arena/status/2108286973119230096"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/xc7shuv3raxyv5xvh59ez8hjf","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"xc7shuv3raxyv5xvh59ez8hjf","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/xc7shuv3raxyv5xvh59ez8hjf","published_at":"2026-10-08T19:01:22Z","ref":"A5","score":66,"selected":true,"source":"Comfy Blog","summary":"ComfyUI 博客作者用智能体搜集各类优化，把 MiniMax H3 实时视频生成压缩到单张 RTX 5090（32 GB 显存）上运行，生成 30 秒视频耗时 23.51 秒，达 1.28 倍实时吞吐。","title":"如何在单张 RTX 5090 上用 MiniMax H3 生成实时视频","title_en":"How I Generated Live Video with MiniMax H3 on a Single GPU","url":"https://blog.comfy.org/p/how-i-generated-live-video-with-minimax"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/qtsvk3wzyp2aab3vi62vjyold","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"qtsvk3wzyp2aab3vi62vjyold","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/qtsvk3wzyp2aab3vi62vjyold","published_at":"2026-10-08T18:51:25Z","ref":"A6","score":67,"selected":true,"source":"X：Arena (@arena)","summary":"Arena 宣布完成由 Lightspeed 领投的 2 亿美元 B 轮融资，估值 31 亿美元。引用内容称其年化收入已超 1 亿美元，数百万用户通过真实使用帮助评估前沿模型；Arena 同时推出 Alignment Index，衡量 AI 行为在真实场景中与人类价值的契合程度。","title":"Arena 获 Lightspeed 领投 2 亿美元 B 轮融资，估值 31 亿美元并推出 Alignment Index","ti